  /// Sends interpretation status to the glasses.
  /// Native source: `DeviceSimInterOrder.sendDeviceSimInterState`.
  static List<int> sendSimInterStatus(int statusCode) {
    return GlassesFrame.build(
      id: _simInterId,
      subId: 0x06,
      payload: [statusCode],
    );
  }

  /// Notifies glasses of TTS playback state.
  /// Native source: `DeviceSimInterOrder.sendDeviceSimInterTtsState`.
  static List<int> sendSimInterTtsState({required bool isEnd}) {
    return GlassesFrame.build(
      id: _simInterId,
      subId: 0x05,
      payload: [isEnd ? 2 : 1],
    );
  }
```

### 设备 → App（`GlassesResponseParser` 入站）

| subId | 事件类型 | 含义 |
|-------|----------|------|
| **0x01** | `GlassesSimInterCommandEvent` | 眼镜按钮启停 + `asrLanguageId` / `transLanguageId` |
| **0x04** | `GlassesSimInterRecordEvent` | 眼镜端录音状态（0=停，1=录） |

```155:169:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/common/common_glasses_protocol/lib/src/protocol/glasses_response_parser.dart
    // 0x46/0x01 — device-initiated siminter toggle (start/stop + language IDs)
    if (id == _simInterId && subId == 0x01) {
      if (payload.isEmpty) return null;
      return GlassesSimInterCommandEvent(
        enable: payload[0] == 1,
        asrLanguageId: payload.length > 1 ? payload[1] : 0,
        transLanguageId: payload.length > 2 ? payload[2] : 0,
      );
    }

    // 0x46/0x04 — device recording state change (0=stop, 1=start)
    if (id == _simInterId && subId == 0x04) {
      if (payload.isEmpty) return null;
      return GlassesSimInterRecordEvent(isRecording: payload[0] == 1);
    }
```

