## 4. `InterpretationController` BLE 推送调用方式

统一入口 `_sendBleFrame` → `glassesCommandSenderProvider.send(frame)`：

```799:841:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/ai/feature_interpretation/lib/src/controller/interpretation_controller.dart
  void _sendTranslationFinalToGlasses(TransResult trans) {
    if (!trans.isFinal || trans.text.isEmpty) return;
    _sendBleFrame(
      GlassesOrder.sendSimInterText(
        content: trans.text,
        isStream: false,
        isAsr: false,
      ),
      'translation_final',
    );
  }

  Future<Result<void>> _setDeviceRecording(bool enabled) {
    // ...
    return ref
        .read(glassesCommandSenderProvider)
        .setRecording(enabled: enabled);
  }

  void _sendBleFrame(List<int> frame, String reason) {
    // ...
    ref
        .read(glassesCommandSenderProvider)
        .send(frame)
        .then<void>(/* ... */);
  }
```

实际推送行为：

| 时机 | BLE 动作 |
|------|----------|
| `start()` / `resume()` | `setRecording(true)` + `sendSimInterStatus(0)` |
| `stop()` | `setRecording(false)` + `sendSimInterStatus(0)` |
| `pause()` | `setRecording(false)` + `sendSimInterStatus(1)` |
| socket error | `sendSimInterStatus(2)` |
| 录音超时 | `sendSimInterStatus(3)` |
| 译文 `isFinal` | `sendSimInterText(isStream:false, isAsr:false)` |
| TTS 音频 | **仅手机播放** `engine.pushTtsPcm()`，**未调用** `sendSimInterTtsState` |
| ASR 文字 | **不推送**到眼镜 |
| 设备事件 `0x46/0x01` | 更新 `selectedLanguagesProvider` 并 `start()`/`stop()` |

`feature_translate` 复用同一文字推送：

```285:298:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/ai/feature_translate/lib/src/controller/translate_controller.dart
  void _pushTranslationToGlasses(String text) {
    if (text.isEmpty || !_bleConnected) return;
    try {
      ref.read(glassesCommandSenderProvider).send(
        GlassesOrder.sendSimInterText(
          content: text,
          isStream: false,
          isAsr: false,
        ),
      );
    } catch (e) { /* ... */ }
  }
```

